<HowTo id="studio.messages" />

You can also comment on a day in a client's food diary; the message shows that day with it.

Messages is one inbox: your clients' conversations, your direct messages and people asking you to
coach them, with **All**, **Unread** and **Requests** to narrow it. Beside a client's conversation
is what you'd otherwise open a second tab for: their program and week, sessions this week, their
last check-in, their weight trend and when they're paid until, with a way to their training and
program. A request opens in Clients › Requests, where you answer it.

## Saved replies

<FeatureFacts id="coach-saved-replies" />

Type **/** at the start of any message box to pick one of your saved replies: keep typing to
narrow the list (`/sw` finds `/swap`), then Enter puts it in the box with **{first name}**,
**{exercise}** (when they've asked about an exercise in their program) and **{coach name}** filled
in. You can still change it before sending. Make and edit them from Messages › ⋯ › Saved replies;
they're plain text.

